type#name.string
    | Min Length: 1
    | Max Length: 32
    | Allowed Characters: [a-z0-9]

type#password.string
    | Min Length: 6
    | Max Length: 32

type#access-token.string
    | JWT with the following properties
    ttl infinity
    user_id.id
    username

type#id.uint
    | Positive number, when used in databases / schemas it autoincrements

type#url
    | Generic url

type#youtube-url.url
    | Valid mobile or web youtube url

type#duration.string
    | Time expressed in duration units, ex. 1h, 2h, 5m, 25s, etc...

type#pagination.object
    | Represents a pagination
    skip.uint
    limit.uint(min=1, max=50)

type#text
    | Arbitrary non blank text, Min Length: 1

type#youtube-search
    | Result type of the yt-dlp video search
    title.text
    url.youtube-url
    duration.duration
    thumbnail.url.optional